  "lines": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "It's early December and every story you tap is the same screenshot.",
      "start": 0.133,
      "end": 4.8,
      "matched": "12/12"
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "Someone's top five artists.",
      "start": 4.96,
      "end": 6.64,
      "matched": "4/4"
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "Someone's minutes listened.",
      "start": 6.8,
      "end": 8.32,
      "matched": "3/3"
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "Someone's top song, which is a bit embarrassing.",
      "start": 8.96,
      "end": 12.16,
      "matched": "8/8"
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "Spotify didn't pay for a single one of those posts.",
      "start": 12.297,
      "end": 15.52,
      "matched": "10/10"
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "You'd think Wrapped is just a fun recap for the fans.",
      "start": 15.56,
      "end": 18.72,
      "matched": "11/11"
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "It's an ad.",
      "start": 18.8,
      "end": 19.92,
      "matched": "3/3"
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "Posted by you.",
      "start": 20.0,
      "end": 21.376,
      "matched": "3/3"
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "And you're happy to post it.",
      "start": 21.504,
      "end": 23.0,
      "matched": "6/6"
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "Because it isn't really about Spotify.",
      "start": 23.04,
      "end": 25.44,
      "matched": "6/6"
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "It's about you.",
      "start": 25.507,
      "end": 26.6,
      "matched": "3/3"
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "Your taste.",
      "start": 26.64,
      "end": 27.64,
      "matched": "2/2"
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "Your weird year.",
      "start": 27.68,
      "end": 29.093,
      "matched": "3/3"
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "So you share it the way you'd never share an ad.",
      "start": 29.147,
      "end": 31.76,
      "matched": "11/11"
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "In 2022, more than 156 million people went through theirs.",
      "start": 31.84,
      "end": 36.92,
      "matched": "10/10"
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "And every share put Spotify's name in front of their friends.",
      "start": 36.96,
      "end": 40.48,
      "matched": "11/11"
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "So if you sell anything, give your customers something about themselves worth posting.",
      "start": 40.549,
      "end": 45.253,
      "matched": "13/13"
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "Their results.",
      "start": 45.307,
      "end": 46.32,
      "matched": "2/2"
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "Their numbers.",
      "start": 46.4,
      "end": 47.24,
      "matched": "2/2"
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "Their before and after.",
      "start": 47.28,
      "end": 48.893,
      "matched": "4/4"
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "Because nobody screenshots your ad.",
      "start": 48.96,
      "end": 51.093,
      "matched": "5/5"
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "They screenshot themselves.",
      "start": 51.147,
      "end": 52.88,
      "matched": "3/3"
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "text": "Send this to the friend whose clients get the same boring report every month.",
      "start": 52.96,
      "end": 57.2,
      "matched": "14/14"
    }
